msgid "A manga reader that connects to your personal Kavita server."
msgstr "连接个人 Kavita 服务器的漫画阅读器。"

msgid "API key"
msgstr "API 密钥"

msgid "Add Kavita server"
msgstr "添加 Kavita 服务器"

msgid "Adjust"
msgstr "调整"

msgid "Adjust image contrast (gamma). Higher values increase contrast for darker blacks. 1.0 is no adjustment."
msgstr "调整图像对比度（伽马值）。数值越高，黑色越深、对比越强；1.0 表示不做调整。"

msgid "Auto rotation adjusts screen orientation automatically. Locked keeps the current system rotation fixed."
msgstr "“自动”会根据设备方向自动调整屏幕方向；“锁定”则保持当前系统旋转方向不变。"

msgid "Automatically trim uniform white or black margins around page content (Mihon-style). Each page is analyzed after download; pages without uniform borders are left unchanged. Detection adds a one-time decode per page."
msgstr "自动裁掉页面内容周围纯白或纯黑的边距（类似 Mihon）。每页下载后都会进行分析；没有统一边框的页面保持原样。检测会给每页增加一次解码开销。"

msgid "Background Color"
msgstr "背景颜色"

msgid "Boost color saturation to make colors pop on dim e-ink screens. 1.0 = neutral, higher = more vivid, lower = desaturated (0 = grayscale). Uses a smart curve that protects already-vivid colors from clipping and leaves grays untouched. Only affects color rendering."
msgstr "提升色彩饱和度，让颜色在较暗的电子墨水屏上更鲜艳。1.0 为中性，数值越高越鲜艳，越低越淡（0 为灰度）。采用智能曲线，避免原本鲜艳的颜色溢出，同时不改变灰色。仅影响彩色渲染。"

msgid "Cancelled"
msgstr "已取消"

