msgid "Controls internal rendering resolution. Low/High cap rendering based on screen size to save memory on large images. Native always uses full image resolution. Images smaller than threshold are never upscaled."
msgstr "控制内部渲染分辨率。“低”/“高”会根据屏幕尺寸限制渲染大小，以便在大图上节省内存；“原生”始终使用完整图像分辨率。小于阈值的图像不会被放大。"

